    CLI --> Events

    API --> UnifiedClient
    Lint --> UnifiedClient
    Get --> UnifiedClient
    Deps --> UnifiedClient
    Components --> UnifiedClient
    Status --> UnifiedClient
    Logs --> UnifiedClient
    Migrate --> UnifiedClient
    Events --> UnifiedClient

    UnifiedClient --> DynamicClient
    UnifiedClient --> DiscoveryClient
    UnifiedClient --> ApiExtClient
    UnifiedClient --> OLMClient
    UnifiedClient --> MetadataClient
    UnifiedClient --> TypedClient

    Migrate --> RBACCheck
    Migrate --> OLMInstall
    Events --> EventFilter

    UnifiedClient -->|HTTPS/6443<br/>kubeconfig auth| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API Server]
    EventFilter -->|Watch/WSS| K8sAPI
    OLMInstall -->|manages| OLM[OLM Resources<br/>Subscriptions, CSVs,<br/>OperatorGroups]
    EventFilter -->|uses| ClusterHealth[opendatahub-operator<br/>clusterhealth library]

    MCP -->|serves| MCPClient[MCP Client<br/>mark3labs/mcp-go]

